    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI niye Nyasaye, yenyene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhwinamile ebifwanani nobusilu.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababaatsa eshifwanani eshibaatse bosi nibutswa; nebienebio ebia bachamanga muno shibikaasila eshindu, kata abaloli babwe abeene shibalola kata okhumanya ta; mbu mana bafwimbwe omurwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwina owakhola omunyasaye, kata okhwirulula eshifwanani, eshibula inganga yosi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, abeshisango shiashio balafwimbwa omurwe; ne ababaatsi nabandu nabandu; bakhung'aane halala, nibeema; balatechela nibafwimbwa omurwe halala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwiraanyi akasia olubaatsilo, nakasia amaanda, nashikhola nende tsinyoli, nashiiraanya nende omukhonokwe kwamaani; yee, inzala yimuluma, amaanike nikeenya okhuhwa; shianywa amatsi ta, mana atora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omubaatsi akhwesa olutsaha, lukololoshe; ashikhuurakhwo nende olukalamu; ashibaatsa nende tsinzube, nashikhuurakhwo nende ibikari, nashibaatsa mukhufwana khwomundu, shinga likondo liomundu olwa lili, mbu ashimenyie munzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeeremela emisiita, nabukula omutirisa, kata omuruba, okwa yeelobolela mumisaala chiomumutsuru; araaka omutaraakwe, ifula niyikunesia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana kuba tsikhwi tsiomundu; abukulakhwo, niyoora omulilo; ahambia omulilo, nateekha omukaate; akhola omunyasaye, namwinamila; akukhola eshifwanani eshibaatse, niyeekhupa hasi imbeli washio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asamba eshitonye shiakwo mumulilo; yeekhoonyela eshitonye shiakwo okhulia inyama; asamba inyama, niyeekura; yee, yoora omulilo, naboola ari Eee, endunduumile omubili; enduutsi omulilo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne eshitonye eshitong'a ashikhola omunyasaye, nishio eshifwananishie eshibaatse; yeekhupa hasi imbeli washio nashiinamila, nashisaayakhwo, nasunga ari Umbonie; shichila niwe nyasaye wanje!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shibamanyanga, kata shibayililisia ta; okhuba yabatimbiye tsimoni, mbu baleshe okhulola, nende emioyo chiabwe, mbu baleshe okhutiila khushisina ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulaho owitsulila, kata khubulaho okhumanya kata okhutiila khushisina, okhuchila nibaboola mbu Ndasambile eshitonye shiakwo mumulilo; toto, khandi ndateeshile omukaate khumaanda kakwo; ndasambile inyama ninjiliane ekhole eshitonye eshitong'a eshiomusiloi Ndikhupe hasi imbeli weshisichili shiomusaala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliitsanga likoshe; omwoyo okwakaatibwa nikwo okwamushiamiye, naye shianyala okhwihonia kata okhusunga mbu Shibuliho obubeeyi mumukhono kwanje omusaatsa? Tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI niye Omununuli WaIsiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
